hostname access1
!
no aaa root
!
spanning-tree mode mstp
!
interface Ethernet1
 description phone-a voice access (configure VLAN 20)
!
interface Ethernet2
 description 802.1Q uplink to dist1 (configure VLANs 10,20,30)
